AccountFactoryV3 composition and read-only account inspection
├── given creation dependencies
│   ├── partial account, wrong layout, UUPS slot or upgrade library metadata -> reject factory construction
│   ├── both fixed library hashes -> capture and enforce runtime drift
│   └── real EntryPoint -> unchanged gas/validation rules, full Account execution (no auth probe override)
│       └── trace includes library initialization AND production signature predicate
├── given counterfactual or pending creation
│   ├── absent code -> report not deployed; never create or reserve
│   └── initialized but not validated -> observe identity only, never mark spend-ready
├── given user-authorized UUPS upgrade
│   ├── stale expectation -> reject without calling unknown delegated getters
│   ├── current expectation -> same address, actual implementation/version, no writes
│   ├── original initializer -> cannot overwrite upgraded implementation
│   └── retired initial implementation -> current inspection and direct spend still work
└── given adversarial current state
    ├── any expected tuple field, proxy, identity, code or library mismatch -> reject
    ├── security proposal/freeze -> no mutation or reset
    └── upgrade library unavailable -> full-profile inspection fails, independent direct exit remains usable
